@startuml analysis-class
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 110
skinparam ranksep 110
title Recipe Builder - Analysis-Level Class Diagram
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class User
class Pantry
class Ingredient
class DietaryPreference
class RecipeSearch
class RecipeMatch
class Recipe
class NutritionFacts
class NutritionRow
class ShoppingItem
class ShoppingChecklist
class CostBreakdown
class Favorite
class Note
class Collection
class Rating
class RatingSummary


' The cook and what they keep
User "1" -- "1" Pantry : keeps >
Pantry "1" o-- "0..*" Ingredient : contains >
User "1" -- "0..1" DietaryPreference : saves >

' Searching
RecipeSearch "1" --> "1" Pantry : uses >
RecipeSearch "1" --> "0..1" DietaryPreference : filtered by >
RecipeSearch "1" *-- "0..*" RecipeMatch : produces >
RecipeMatch "0..*" --> "1" Recipe : refers to >

' A recipe's details
Recipe "1" *-- "0..1" NutritionFacts
NutritionFacts "1" *-- "1..*" NutritionRow
Recipe "1" *-- "1..*" ShoppingItem : needs >
ShoppingChecklist "0..*" --> "1" Recipe : ticks items of >
Recipe "1" -- "0..1" CostBreakdown : priced by >
CostBreakdown "0..*" --> "1" Pantry : compared with >

' Saving and rating
User "1" *-- "0..*" Favorite : saves >
Favorite "0..*" --> "1" Recipe
Favorite "1" *-- "0..1" Note
User "1" *-- "0..*" Collection : owns >
Collection "0..1" o-- "0..*" Favorite : groups >
User "1" -- "0..*" Rating : gives >
Rating "0..*" --> "1" Recipe : rates >
Recipe "1" -- "1" RatingSummary : average of ratings >

legend right
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | Box | a concept in the app (not a Java class) |
  | Plain line | the two concepts are related; the label says how |
  | Arrow head | the direction to read the label, e.g. RecipeMatch "refers to" Recipe |
  | Filled diamond | composition: the part cannot exist without the whole (deleting a favorite deletes its note) |
  | Hollow diamond | aggregation: the parts can exist on their own (deleting a collection keeps its favorites) |
  | 1 | exactly one |
  | 0..1 | none or one |
  | 0..* | any number, including none |
  | 1..* | at least one |
endlegend
@enduml
